            <title>[ZEPPELIN-4662] Spark driver OOM cause Connection refused error in frontend</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-4662</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It is fine and normal for spark driver OOM, but displaying connection refused error is confusing for users.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We&apos;d better to display more meaningful error like the yarn diagnostics info&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
Application application_1582123696205_6168 failed 1 times (global limit =2; local limit is =1) due to AM Container &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; appattempt_1582123696205_6168_000001 exited with exitCode: -104Failing &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;this&lt;/span&gt; attempt.Diagnostics: Container [pid=28373,containerID=container_1582123696205_6168_01_000001] is running beyond physical memory limits. Current usage: 1.4 GB of 1.4 GB physical memory used; 3.3 GB of 6.7 TB virtual memory used. Killing container. &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
